<title>UK: QUALITY: Lufthansa UK Q1 cargo report.</title>
<headline>QUALITY: Lufthansa UK Q1 cargo report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa Cargo AG, a unit of Deutsche Lufthansa AG, has issued its report on service standards it achieved at London Heathrow airport between January-March 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;We have set our initial target at (achieving) 95 percent,&quot; said the company's UK quality standards co-ordinator, Robert Fordree.</p>
<p>Customer commitment by Lufthansa	   Achievement Q1</p>
<p>Average delivery queuing time</p>
<p>   (side-load) - 45 mins				38 mins</p>
<p>Average delivery queuing time</p>
<p>   (back-load) - 30 mins				25 mins</p>
<p>Average import collection time</p>
<p>		     30 mins				21 mins</p>
<p>Flown as booked					   94.3 pct</p>
<p>Claims - initial response within</p>
<p>   seven working days				   98.0 pct</p>
<p>Claims - final settlement within 4 weeks	  99.0 pct</p>
<p>Import documents available to customer within:</p>
<p>   90 mins (passenger aircraft)		     99.2 pct</p>
<p>   60 mins (freighter aircraft)		     99.2 pct</p>
<p>Express documents available to customer within:</p>
<p>   60 mins (passenger aircraft)		     99.2 pct</p>
<p>   30 mins (freighter aircraft)		     99.2 pct</p>
<p>Import freight available within:</p>
<p>   6 hours (widebody and freighter aircraft)    99.2 pct</p>
<p>   2 hours (narrow-body aircraft)		   99.2 pct</p>
<p>Import express freight available within:</p>
<p>   2 hours (wide-body)</p>
<p>								98.9 pct</p>
<p>   1.5 hrs (freighter and narrow-body aircraft) 98.9 pct Handling reports (five working days)		97.6 pct</p>
<p>Telephone answering - answered within 20 seconds (exports/imports/sales/reservations/accounts)  92.6 pct</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017</p>
